  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.0d5a081f061d": "Three generation-0 bolts. Each extra sibling consumes one lineage proc.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.2fcbea50c081": "The extra bolt is generation 0 and shares the lineage proc budget. Children do not inherit this extra sibling.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.43e4f65df66f": "Reads the live tether target id. Other targets are unchanged. Does not rewrite Massline attachment or fire-control.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.4e3fed35e0ca": "Connects the existing Ionized status to chain propagation. Does not grant hops; Relay Arc or Bank Relay still author the chain budget.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.576ba27f69c4": "Each bounce consumes one lineage proc. Ordinary enemy shots are unchanged.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.6abe4cf3dad4": "Each child consumes two lineage procs, is generation 1, and cannot split again.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.83b0b5e05fe1": "Adds spread only. No extra roots, no payload scale, no speed grant. You cover a wider lane and pay heat.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.8d91a24993d2": "Cryo Lock preserves translational momentum and reduces control authority. It is never a hard stop.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.a1f9d4047fa0": "Uses the existing Ionized status. Ionized is the chain-conduction prerequisite; it does not spawn a second status system.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.a92f343eca27": "Uses the existing Burning status and its periodic thermal packet. Combat owns the ticks; this trait only authors the payload.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.ab0dffb5d147": "Connects ricochet to chain. Once a bounce has happened, hops use the shared proc budget and visited set. Direct contacts never start the chain.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.c5e5e2af59a4": "Pierce continues the same projectile. It is not a descendant and does not consume proc budget. Split children do not inherit pierce.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.cdcb8ee8f725": "Uses the existing Gravity Marked status. Field coupling stays owned by the field kernel; this trait only marks the target.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.dc69a9bdaf9f": "Each node spends five lineage procs. The ring does nothing while you sit still; you have to fly a node onto the target. Weak outward impulse is a field, not a colliding body.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.e8c2b8ffe949": "One steering event per bounce. Target order is deterministic. Cone and turn caps are compiled, not rolled. Does not grant extra bounces.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.detail.fcee7da6e7a2": "Each hop spends two lineage procs, cannot revisit a target, and selects by score then distance then id. Chain children inherit payload and further hops, not split.",
  "loc.src.data.attacktraits.field.name.05355cd3dba2": "Cryo Gyros",
