  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.12fd7c084015": "Fabricates a permanent acceleration ring and nav relay on the clear line to this claim’s linked station. Travel Burn is amplified only while the ship remains inside that physical corridor.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.285ed5f73a7f": "Automated turret that protects the body from raids. Required on dangerous frontier claims.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.2b701c74fca8": "Runs the fitted battery as a garrison. Warns of raids on your claims in this sector and contests them with stationed guns. Highest upkeep; produces nothing.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.55f3c82f7f16": "Auto-refines raw ore into materials at a fixed rate, no station visit needed. Lighter, dearer goods to ship.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.72ee331c6bd2": "Runs the fitted refinery as a working site. Deliver raw ore here; crews process it into refined goods you haul out. Stocked sites draw raiders in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.82bd0b7e236a": "Runs the fitted depot as a freight relay. Deposit goods; scheduled convoys haul them to the linked station and sell at the local market price less the relay fee. Convoys risk piracy in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ad7c24a20084": "Links this body to a chosen station. Collapses your worst lane to a single jump — classic automation that rewrites the map.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.b4719cabddda": "A dropoff point for your drones. Drones assigned a depot template route here. Stores overflow ore.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ed653dbc9994": "Extends discovery pulses to hidden POIs across this claim’s sector and files one free local rumor card per sector-day. It does not reveal exact positions or widen combat contact scans.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.01642dc73cfc": "Sensor Post",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.83e6d2c39c44": "Trade Relay",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.8753cfbfde6c": "On-Site Refinery",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.b68516dbcd7a": "Cargo Depot",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.d63aec22c4f6": "Defense Battery",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.d75a1bd5c569": "Quantum Teleporter",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.f2e5ed43805c": "Defense Bastion",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.fb8a648bdc1e": "Throughline Sling",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.ff3860945618": "Industrial Refinery",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.2f262329bd32": "bleed the capacitor first, commit only against a scrambled hull",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.3296eae170ce": "one hull fakes the egress to buy the flank a free pass",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.796952e8ad24": "the ward holds before the kill does — screening outguns pressing",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.dcde110c0448": "the pack commits on one beat — pincer pressure instead of a trickle of singles",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.ec9293e3e91b": "allocate guns to the weakest hull in reach, not the loudest threat",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.ece77e0b74d3": "every salvo from a new bearing — the standoff never repeats a firing solution",
  "loc.src.data.combatdefs.field.summary.fbb7e4635b86": "the wake is the weapon — the wing presses to keep you inside the seeded lane",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.41b880cc8fc9": "Seed",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.485901929e28": "Hull",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.556d374a73c4": "Enemy package",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.72faea7b8a50": "Starting wave",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.bcbb6beaa089": "Arena",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.label.c4157cc024b8": "Starter loadout",
  "loc.src.data.combatlab.field.title.727e00ef0252": "Combat Lab",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.blurb.261a5501a713": "Stitch pursuers together, then shove the knot into cover. The pack becomes its own obstacle.",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.blurb.87d5ebc6fe9b": "Bank a stream of bullets around cover. Shove the pack into the rocks, then boost through.",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.blurb.a928742e88fe": "The nimble, slow Hornet. Same gun, different bells.",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.blurb.b0bf4678c42c": "One pulse gun, every shot able to bank. The kit the Foundry teaches with.",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.blurb.f199038dda04": "Everything in the drive, nothing in the bells. Crosses the room first and regrets it.",
  "loc.src.data.combatlabsetups.field.label.0a0be0367981": "Mixed Screen",
