  "loc.src.data.frontierregions.south.field.body.0ee8b1740845": "A colossal arc segment of an ancient orbital megastructure orbiting the frozen dark. Dry river basins and dormant metropolis grids curve across the interior circumference, powered by deep geothermal reserves that have outlived the system's dead primary.",
