  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.0594f235726a": "If the wreck wakes, hunt it.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.063746a97936": "Do not fire a shot.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.0dbaa706c1d4": "Hold under {STEADY_SPEED_LIMIT} wu/s.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.1e8ea1604d23": "Land one Massline throw.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.3a0ac488f9c6": "Land one solid mass strike.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.4f2d2727ddef": "If the pods are bait, clear the field.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.5d108a3b39a5": "Break one core chunk loose.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.6a659bfc2cf7": "If the escort turns, hunt them.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.71b0eca3e761": "Arrive under {BERTH_SPEED} wu/s.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.7ba5fd0019f4": "Do not let the line go slack.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.9620b5c19d1c": "Land one clean Massline release.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.b89c426a12d7": "Do not crack the freight.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.c64341244670": "Land three vent bonuses.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.ccca450cdb0b": "Approach the drop cold.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.e9e1d9e62f30": "Do not blow or break your cloak.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.fb8d2a582b0b": "If the buyer is the law, reroute.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.brief.fc11cb7190a2": "If the cargo cooks, recover it.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.10ccc2c25259": "Silent runner",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.3a68d9a9297c": "One clean release",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.5d1a0ec129af": "The pods are bait",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.7c2242d8ba52": "Line under tension",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.7d006462a797": "Cold approach",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.7dd0cc4d5cc1": "The buyer is the law",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.828cc6a5c425": "Cargo is volatile",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.b0cb6357c392": "Break a core loose",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.bf086640b6e3": "Come alongside",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.c346f6a8f8a3": "Steady hands",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.ca40f8f23abe": "Fragile — intact",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.ca6429ab9cac": "The escort turns",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.ceda4230d8da": "Weapons cold",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.d389dddaf007": "The wreck wakes",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.de77af8289c7": "Throw it",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.e4cf38f7c4d3": "Three clean vents",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.label.e96754b59f7a": "Put mass on them",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.022bc83af914": "This hull may still have a crew. Wake it and the salvage becomes a hunt — the wreck stays the reason to be here.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.0e3af7db8ff1": "The distress may be an ambush. Close on the pods and the rescue becomes a field-clear — the pods stay in the picture.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.4b808dfb5a60": "Land one solid mass strike on this job — a rock, a wreck, anything with weight behind it.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.4c0602c3d878": "This lot can cook mid-run. If it slams, the job becomes a recovery — not a voided manifest.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.4de3c1384026": "This freight does not survive a hard knock. Crack any of it and the contract is void.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.6b14c54c2c56": "The drop may be a sting. Come in close and the contract reroutes — you still have a buyer, just not this one.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.80b0c220294e": "This convoy may show its real colours mid-run. If they turn, the job becomes a hunt — it does not die in a red box.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.820c953dc6d1": "Come into the destination quiet — no sustained burn above {QUIET_APPROACH_SPEED} wu/s inside {QUIET_APPROACH_RANGE_WU} wu of it.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.82ce80487176": "Crack something big enough to leave a core chunk behind. That is what the refinery is short of.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.8688a5e50a5c": "Once you are on the load, keep the line working. Three seconds of slack forfeits the recovery premium.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.96472da14c84": "The buyer is paying for technique: land three vent bonuses while you fill this.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.9664c6d26648": "Keep your cloak discipline intact on this run — do not let the cloak blow out or break under fire.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.9a8975cb9458": "Show them the line works: one clean or razor release logged before you file this.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.be487eab6a7e": "Never exceed {STEADY_SPEED_LIMIT} wu/s while the manifest is aboard. The premium is paid on a calm run.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.e4b15f7ef967": "Match the berth before you hand over: inside {BERTH_RANGE_WU} wu of the destination and under {BERTH_SPEED} wu/s.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.f27065723256": "Finish at least one of them with a thrown mass, not a gun.",
  "loc.src.data.missionconditions.field.prose.f49396350019": "Run this one without firing. Shove, tow and outfly — but do not shoot.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.049db13cfb55": "Put mass on the ace, or outgun the ace. No immunity.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.417a47918b1f": "Yank the hatch off its pins, or smash it with thrown mass.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.4fdd756eb187": "Bowl mass through the mines, or reel the line open.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.52d2aa92d079": "Put mass through the Ashfall dreadnought. Guns are the slow way. No immunity.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.5a8250734813": "Tow a pod home, or open a corridor and reel from stand-off.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.659b743f51f2": "Reel the cradle quiet, or put mass through the lock.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.662c653bb1cd": "A 200-mass core. Fit a frame coupler (shipworks, Tractor Systems) or fight the pendulum in.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.938e3dea5fb6": "Yank the spinning reliquary off its clamps, or bowl iron through the pins.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.984dd2773a8e": "Throw the charge into the jaws, or cut the feed belt.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.bee398370812": "Recatch the stripped pod, or drive the raiders off the lane.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.c150772973d3": "Park the hulk on the approach, or swing it through the wedge.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.ca4286ff09b8": "Yank the 47-A routing core off the archive barge, or smash the bay with slag.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.cb9de03bc1da": "Put mass through the ex-patrol capital. Guns are the slow way. No immunity.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.ce4322e85061": "Keep the core on the line into the yard, or sling it in.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.d8eb8d850623": "Swing mass through the tower, or cut it down.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.brief.ef3a31234909": "Put mass through the heavy. Guns are the slow way. No immunity.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.displayname.0a36df537d69": "Kell Orr",
