  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.03427e401963": "Ten disposable lights, two mediums and three collision anchors for force-first combat.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.0d3439f5923e": "Launch beside the refinery working pocket on the real Ceres route and systems.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.2fb3815984be": "Start latched to a distant heavy anchor. Check forward+turn yaw at a long radius.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.574694eee756": "Start off The Anvil with two physical route anchors and the normal Massline controls.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.6fb7c2193f05": "Max credits, full tech, all factions friendly. Pick ship and sector below.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.724a01d960c2": "Every weapon and module, full tech tree, 500k credits, best gun auto-equipped.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.90369d0e9dcd": "One anchor, two targets, the physics kit. Latch, swing, and throw a target into collision — relaunch to reset. Nothing here pays or records.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.9778f7a1f1a6": "Spawn beside an asteroid and open the deep-drill minigame.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.9f4af09f88a6": "A crossing neutral target tests preview, natural acquisition and moving-body latch.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.a4991e57ff7f": "A dense mixed combat cast, inert targets and terrain for ordinary-scale VFX review.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.bf12c7411b27": "A solid loadout with a flight of hostile swarmers inbound.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.de76685faecd": "Stage near the real Tethys launcher before a physical cargo capsule departs.",
  "loc.src.ui.sandbox.sandboxsetup.field.description.e18a1fb480e5": "Start latched close to a heavy anchor. Check fast swing yaw and raw-control release.",
